# 真・女神転生if... (Shin Megami Tensei if..., SHVC-AMXJ): the characters of its font by code (two bytes, high first),
# the code a glyph's number in the font plus 0x0D, as Shin Megami Tensei numbers its font. The game keeps no code of
# what it shows: games/sfc/SHVC-AMXJ.glyphs, made from these and the font in the cartridge, is what its script reads.
# Digits, letters and kana by the font's order (Shin Megami Tensei's: hiragana and katakana in the order of the
# fifty sounds); the signs and the kanji held against the pictures of the pages they were drawn in, in play.
